  "2026-11-05T16:39:55.580Z",codex-agent,"Review round 6: fetched all unresolved threads and all comments (two threads, no pagination); latest CodeRabbit review has no outside-diff findings. Verified branch is current with remote and includes main. Plan: identify the CLI-owned total deadline by signal reason identity, preserve unrelated errors, qualify duplicate calibration refit scope, add regression and behavioral revert proofs, self-review the full diff, then run unchanged npm and Bun release gates."
  "2026-11-05T16:43:28.874Z",codex-agent,"Verified both round-6 findings. PRRT_kwDOU8IMzs60KhWl: command creates and passes its own timeout signal and maps only rejection identical to its aborted signal reason; unrelated Error, TimeoutError, AbortError, ETIMEDOUT, ESOCKETTIMEDOUT, UND_ERR_CONNECT_TIMEOUT, ABORT_ERR and non-Error failures preserve identity. PRRT_kwDOU8IMzs60KhXC: guide specifies required versus optional refits, identity compatibility, represented candidate counts, eight-candidate evaluation cap and nullable unqualified thresholds. Self-review of the full PR source diff and related guidance found no further instance requiring changes. Existing general decision-error translation remains a separate established API contract."
  "2026-11-05T16:43:30.126Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proofs in a disposable package copy: restoring only admission-command.ts from 093b63c makes the CLI deadline regression fail (1 pass, 1 fail); restoring only docs/decision-admission.md makes the refit contract regression fail (1 pass, 1 fail). Replacing reason-identity checking with broad TimeoutError/ETIMEDOUT matching makes the unrelated-error regression fail (1 pass, 1 fail). Restoring both fixes passes all 4 focused tests. Exact proof commands: node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/admission-command.test.ts; node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/admission-docs.test.ts. No reviewed-worktree mutations were used for revert proofs."
